   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. A revoked user can still log in and keep using the dashboard",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. A revoked user can still log in and keep using the dashboard",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el261",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 100,
   "y": 1141,
   "width": 1240.2,
   "height": 48.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1962578963,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 301126734,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Revocation (UpdateUserStatus, handler.go:2354) only flips is_active on the admin server. There is no revoked/is_active column locally,\nLogin (handler.go:1015) and VerifyLoginOTP (otp_login.go:86) never check it, and existing sessions are not deleted (DeleteAccountSessions exists, unused here).\nFix: store/check status at login + in the session middleware, and call DeleteAccountSessions('user', email, '') on revoke.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Revocation (UpdateUserStatus, handler.go:2354) only flips is_active on the admin server. There is no revoked/is_active column locally,\nLogin (handler.go:1015) and VerifyLoginOTP (otp_login.go:86) never check it, and existing sessions are not deleted (DeleteAccountSessions exists, unused here).\nFix: store/check status at login + in the session middleware, and call DeleteAccountSessions('user', email, '') on revoke.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
