   "locked": false,
   "text": "~40 conn.Exec(...) calls drop the error. Example: if ADD PRIMARY KEY (did) on new_tools fails (NULL/duplicate did), the table is left with NO key and\nINSERT ... ON CONFLICT (did) (service.go:2594) fails for every tool registration. Same for the UNIQUE api_key index (db.go:465) if duplicates exist. Fix: log/fail on error.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "~40 conn.Exec(...) calls drop the error. Example: if ADD PRIMARY KEY (did) on new_tools fails (NULL/duplicate did), the table is left with NO key and\nINSERT ... ON CONFLICT (did) (service.go:2594) fails for every tool registration. Same for the UNIQUE api_key index (db.go:465) if duplicates exist. Fix: log/fail on error.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
