   "locked": false,
   "text": "initiator_name UPDATE joining all interactions (db.go:394), review_status UPDATE, user_dids backfill, BackfillResources() (db.go:691). Startup time grows with data.\nFix: run once (versioned migrations) or guard with a cheap WHERE EXISTS.",
